    "author" : [ "Marc-Andree Wolf", "Nader Jelassi" ],
    "description" : {
      "en" : "The three internal battery locations named by Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex XIII 2(a) for the detailed composition of a battery: cathode, anode and electrolyte. Declared as individuals of batmat:BatteryLocation and used as the value set of batmat:hasBatteryLocation. Corresponds to BatteryPass-Ready Data Attribute Long List v1.3, attribute 41, and to the Spherity Battery Pass class BatteryLocationEntity, which declares no values."
    },
    "labels" : {
      "en" : "EU DPP Battery Locations Vocabulary"
    },
    "comments" : {
      "en" : "Developed against the CIRPASS-2 CORE ontology v2.0.5 (refresh of 25 August 2026; P_DPP v2.0.6 of 27 August 2026, MAT v1.0.2). To be revisited when MAT v2 lands (ontologies-core#24, #25), which introduces a part level that may host these locations."
    },
